      {
        "id": "textbook-superquadric-definition",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-definition",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "definition",
        "title": "教材定义：二次曲面的一般化",
        "markdown": "超二次曲面（superquadrics）是二次曲面的一般化表示。做法是在二次方程中插入额外参数，使同一族方程可以调整对象形状：对曲线增加一个参数，对曲面则增加两个参数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000428"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "超二次曲面"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11425,
              "lineEnd": 11428,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "7f4a95e2d4ebdd665e0c4406a3e677710d73330e6e00ecaa35837b5ba7e06744"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-rounded-square-intuition",
        "moduleId": "problem-and-definition",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：指数是“轮廓旋钮”",
        "markdown": "可以把新增参数想成一个控制轮廓在圆形与方形之间移动的旋钮。半径 $r_x$、$r_y$、$r_z$ 决定图形有多大、沿各轴拉伸多少，指数参数则决定轮廓靠近坐标轴时是尽快转弯（圆滑）还是贴着边界直行（方正）。因此调指数时图形大小不变，变的是它的“棱角”。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-superquadric-definition"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-superellipse-cartesian",
        "moduleId": "superellipse-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材公式：超椭圆的笛卡儿式",
        "markdown": "在椭圆方程中允许 $x$ 和 $y$ 项的指数为变量，就得到超椭圆的笛卡儿表达式。教材给出的一种形式是\n\n$$\n\\left( \\frac{x}{r_x} \\right)^{2/s} + \\left( \\frac{y}{r_y} \\right)^{2/s} = 1\n$$\n\n其中参数 $s$ 是任何实数。当 $s=1$ 时指数为 2，得到一般的椭圆表达式 $\\left(\\frac{x}{r_x}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{y}{r_y}\\right)^2 = 1$。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000429"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "超椭圆"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11429,
              "lineEnd": 11449,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/60985dbb7b32e9933a85d84186935621b9654d4b9f069999cc087df019a7a02e.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "112c33fb91f29e52b83675c1a0c8aa820a3350f297d63c62ceadcafba99dd60c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-superellipse-parametric",
        "moduleId": "superellipse-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材公式：超椭圆的参数式",
        "markdown": "相对于笛卡儿式，超椭圆也可以写成参数方程：\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &= r_x \\cos^{s}\\theta, \\\\\ny &= r_y \\sin^{s}\\theta,\n\\end{aligned}\n\\qquad -\\pi \\leqslant \\theta \\leqslant \\pi\n$$\n\n教材图 13.6 取 $r_x = r_y$，令参数 $s$ 从 0.5 变到 3.0，用同一组半径展示轮廓随指数变化的连续过程。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000429"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "超椭圆"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11429,
              "lineEnd": 11449,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0004/images/60985dbb7b32e9933a85d84186935621b9654d4b9f069999cc087df019a7a02e.jpg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "112c33fb91f29e52b83675c1a0c8aa820a3350f297d63c62ceadcafba99dd60c"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-exponent-direction",
        "moduleId": "superellipse-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：指数取值与轮廓倾向",
        "markdown": "把式中的指数记作 $n = 2/s$，方程就是 $\\left| x/r_x \\right|^{n} + \\left| y/r_y \\right|^{n} = 1$。由方程可直接读出三种情形：\n\n- $s=1$ 时 $n=2$，是椭圆；\n- $s>1$ 时 $n<2$，轮廓被推近四条直线围成的方形边界，$s$ 越大越像圆角矩形；\n- $0<s<1$ 时 $n>2$，轮廓沿坐标轴方向内凹，出现星形或尖角。\n\n这三种情形与教材图 13.6 中 $s$ 从 0.5 到 3.0 的变化方向一致；变化的是轮廓形状，$r_x$ 与 $r_y$ 决定的尺寸并未改变。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-superellipse-cartesian",
            "textbook-superellipse-parametric"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-superellipsoid-cartesian",
        "moduleId": "superellipsoid-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材公式：超椭球面的笛卡儿式",
        "markdown": "在椭球面方程中增加两个指数参数，就得到超椭球面的笛卡儿表达式：\n\n$$\n\\left[ \\left( \\frac{x}{r_x} \\right)^{2/s_2} + \\left( \\frac{y}{r_y} \\right)^{2/s_2} \\right]^{s_2/s_1} + \\left( \\frac{z}{r_z} \\right)^{2/s_1} = 1\n$$\n\n当 $s_1 = s_2 = 1$ 时，该式退化为一般的椭球面。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000430"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "超椭球面"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11450,
              "lineEnd": 11467,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e6112cd2bf79a555df9db13f3a7b7427b55fbb5313a0393dcd4b9de049c1855f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-nested-structure",
        "moduleId": "superellipsoid-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：两层幂次各管一个方向",
        "markdown": "式 (13.11) 是两层结构。内层 $\\left(\\frac{x}{r_x}\\right)^{2/s_2}+\\left(\\frac{y}{r_y}\\right)^{2/s_2}$ 是一次水平截面（$xy$ 平面内）的超椭圆，其形状由 $s_2$ 控制；整个内层再取 $s_2/s_1$ 次幂后与 $\\left(\\frac{z}{r_z}\\right)^{2/s_1}$ 相加，竖直方向的剖面因此由 $s_1$ 控制。读懂这个嵌套关系，就能预判调节哪一个指数会改变哪一组截面。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-superellipsoid-cartesian"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-superellipsoid-parametric",
        "moduleId": "superellipsoid-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "formula",
        "title": "教材公式：超椭球面的参数式与组合用途",
        "markdown": "对应式 (13.11) 的参数表达式为\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nx &= r_x \\cos^{s_1}\\phi \\cos^{s_2}\\theta, \\\\\ny &= r_y \\cos^{s_1}\\phi \\sin^{s_2}\\theta, \\\\\nz &= r_z \\sin^{s_1}\\phi,\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n其中 $-\\pi/2 \\leqslant \\phi \\leqslant \\pi/2$，$-\\pi \\leqslant \\theta \\leqslant \\pi$。教材指出，由 $s_1$ 和 $s_2$ 的不同取值生成的超椭球面形状，与其他超二次曲面形状组合后可以生成家具、螺栓和其他金属构件等复杂形状。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-abebc170f9271e4546887278",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000430"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "计算机图形学(第四版)",
                "超椭球面"
              ],
              "lineStart": 11450,
              "lineEnd": 11467,
              "assetRefs": [],
              "excerptSha256": "e6112cd2bf79a555df9db13f3a7b7427b55fbb5313a0393dcd4b9de049c1855f"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-two-exponents",
        "moduleId": "superellipsoid-mechanism",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "模型补充：s1 与 s2 的分工",
        "markdown": "参数式与笛卡儿式的两层结构互相印证：$\\phi$ 的幂次是 $s_1$，控制从南极到北极的纵剖面；$\\theta$ 的幂次是 $s_2$，控制每一层水平截面的轮廓。因此可以让物体在水平方向方正、竖直方向圆润，也可以反过来，这正是单个指数无法表达的自由度。取 $s_1=s_2=1$ 时两处指数都退化为 1，回到一般椭球面。教材在超椭圆部分说明 $s$ 可为任意实数，但对 $s_1$、$s_2$ 未讨论取负值等使幂次失义的情形；建模时应取使幂运算有定义的参数值。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-superellipsoid-cartesian",
            "model-nested-structure",
            "textbook-superellipsoid-parametric"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-shape-table",
        "moduleId": "parameter-lab",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "table",
        "title": "模型补充：参数与形状对照表",
        "markdown": "下表把式 (13.9)–(13.12) 的结论汇总为可查询的对照，只讨论 $s>0$ 的常见取值区间；$s=1$ 一行同时给出曲面情形。\n\n| 参数取值 | 超椭圆轮廓 | 超椭球面形态 |\n|---|---|---|\n| $s=1$（曲面取 $s_1=s_2=1$） | 椭圆 | 椭球面 |\n| $s>1$ | 趋于方形，棱边变直 | 截面趋于方形，接近方盒 |\n| $0<s<1$ | 沿轴内凹，呈星形 | 内凹并出现尖角 |\n\n读表时注意：$s$ 调的是方形度，不是尺寸；半径 $r_x$、$r_y$、$r_z$ 仍然单独决定三个方向的伸展。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-superellipse-cartesian",
            "model-exponent-direction",
            "textbook-superellipsoid-cartesian",
            "model-two-exponents"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-application",
        "moduleId": "application-and-check",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "application",
        "title": "模型补充：参数化零件建模流程",
        "markdown": "把超二次曲面用作零件库基元时，可以按下面的顺序操作：\n\n1. 按目标物体的包围尺寸确定 $r_x$、$r_y$、$r_z$；\n2. 用 $s_1$ 调整竖直剖面的方形度，用 $s_2$ 调整水平截面的方形度；\n3. 试渲染后微调两个指数，直到棱边圆角程度符合要求。\n\n教材提到这类形状的组合可以生成家具、螺栓和其他金属构件，原因就在于同一套方程只改指数就能在圆润与棱角分明之间连续过渡，无需为每种外形重建网格。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-superellipsoid-parametric",
            "model-shape-table"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-check",
        "moduleId": "application-and-check",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "exercise",
        "title": "模型补充：达成检查",
        "markdown": "1. 写出 $s=1$ 时超椭圆退化成的方程，并说明它对应哪种曲线。\n2. 若希望水平截面从椭圆逐步变为接近方形，应当增大还是减小 $s_2$？说明依据。\n3. 有同学说“把 $s$ 从 1 调到 2，椭圆会放大一倍”。这个说法错在哪里？\n4. 对式 (13.11)，分别指出控制横截面与纵剖面的指数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
